    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d198">

                <pb facs="0422" n="402" xml:id="pg402"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord
                        Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Saturday Evening,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-12-12"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 12, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My dear Lord Lyons</hi>: Your impression in regard to
                    the telegram was correct. Will you have the kindness to repeat your despatch to
                    the governor of New Brunswick, as the Chesapeake may have put into one of the
                    ports of that province?</p>
                <p>Very faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD. </signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
